                <invention-title lang="de">RASIERABDECKUNGSSYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE COUVERCLE DE RASOIR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">RAZOR COVER SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A razor cover system includes a rear component, a front component, and a magnetic component. The front component is configured to couple with the rear component to form an inner volume of the razor cover system. At least a portion of the shaving razor is to be disposed in the inner volume of the razor cover system. The magnetic component is configured to couple to the rear component within the inner volume of the razor cover system. The magnetic component is configured to secure a portion of the handle to the rear component.</p>
            </abstract>
